## 🏗️ Architecture

```
User Interface (CLI/Web) → Mediator → LLM Router Backend
                              ↓
                    Complaint Phases (3-Phase)
                     ├─ Knowledge Graphs
                     ├─ Dependency Graphs
                     └─ Legal Graphs
                              ↓
        Analysis & Research (14 types, Multi-source, IPFS+DuckDB)
                              ↓
              Storage Layer (IPFS Evidence + DuckDB Metadata)
```

